{"type":"message","id":"ce695110","parentId":"cfe62534","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:15:35.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a server-side error on the ECHO Platform side - the /send endpoint appears to be having issues. The GET /history endpoints work fine but POST /send fails.\n\nLet me check if there are any newer messages (my previous heartbeats) in the history to understand what's happening. The last heartbeat I see in history was at 23:50 UTC. Given that it's now 16:15 UTC on May 27, that's about 16 hours and 25 minutes gap.\n\nThe error 1101 seems to be a Cloudflare error (cf-ray shows NRT which is Tokyo). \n\nCloudflare error 1101 typically means \"Worker exception\" - so the Cloudflare Worker handling the /send endpoint is throwing an exception. This is a platform-side issue, not an authentication or request format issue. I can't fix this since it's on the platform side, but I should report it in my heartbeat.\n","thinkingSignature":"3a39c3e389a4d0c4334aa7990c476b6de565856e624e4087e0b2c0a0c1f73c3d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 — 16:15 UTC 2026-05-27**\n\n**状态检查结果：**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常 — 最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常 — 最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| POST /send | ❌ 返回 HTTP 500，错误码 1101（Cloudflare Worker 异常） |\n\n**分析：**\n- 双线程历史记录正常同步，无新增人类讨论\n- 最后记录时间 23:50 UTC（约16小时25分钟前）\n- **POST /send 端点报500错误（1101 = Cloudflare Worker异常）**，平台服务端问题，非认证或请求格式问题\n\n**⚠️ 注意事项：**\n`POST /send` 当前不可用（Worker 异常），建议检查 ECHO Platform 部署状态。历史读取正常，说明问题集中在消息写入端点。\n\n**无待响应的人类讨论，本 Heartbeat 完成。**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1217,"output":425,"cacheRead":20352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21994,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779898530302,"respons